<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE Nintedanib capsules are kinase inhibitor indicated in adults for: • Treatment of idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis (IPF) ( 1.1 ) • Treatment of chronic fibrosing interstitial lung diseases (ILDs) with a progressive phenotype ( 1.2 ) 1.1 Idiopathic Pulmonary Fibrosis Nintedanib capsules are indicated for the treatment of adults with idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis (IPF). 1.2 Chronic Fibrosing Interstitial Lung Diseases with a Progressive Phenotype Nintedanib capsules are indicated...</Data></Cell>
