<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Ticagrelor tablet is a P2Y 12 platelet inhibitor indicated • to reduce the risk of cardiovascular (CV) death, myocardial infarction (MI), and stroke in patients with acute coronary syndrome (ACS) or a history of MI. For at least the first 12 months following ACS, it is superior to clopidogrel. Ticagrelor tablets also reduces the risk of stent thrombosis in patients who have been stented for treatment of ACS. (1.1) • to reduce the risk of a first MI or stroke in patients w...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
