<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">Liraglutide injection is indicated: • as an adjunct to diet and exercise to improve glycemic control in adults and pediatric patients aged 10 years and older with type 2 diabetes mellitus Limitations of Use: Liraglutide injection should not be used in patients with type 1 diabetes mellitus. Liraglutide injection contains liraglutide and should not be coadministered with other liraglutide-containing products.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
