<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">03/03/2025</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">Supplemental</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">ZYDUS PHARMS</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Oseltamivir Phosphate is an influenza neuraminidase inhibitor (NAI) indicated for: Treatment of acute, uncomplicated influenza A and B in patients 2 weeks of age and older who have been symptomatic for no more than 48 hours. ( 1.1 ) Prophylaxis of influenza A and B in patients 1 year and older. ( 1.2 ) Limitations of Use : Not a substitute for annual influenza vaccination. ( 1.3 ) Consider available information on influenza drug susceptibility patterns and treatment effec...</Data></Cell>
