<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE GAZYVA is a CD20-directed cytolytic antibody indicated: in combination with chlorambucil, for the treatment of patients with previously untreated chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL). ( 1.1 , 14 ) in combination with bendamustine followed by GAZYVA monotherapy, for the treatment of patients with follicular lymphoma (FL)who relapsed after, or are refractory to, a rituximab-containing regimen. ( 1.2 , 14 ) in combination with chemotherapy followed by GAZYVA monotherapy in pat...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
<Row>
