<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">New Drug Application</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">AVYXA HOLDINGS</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE OXDERYS is an anthracycline topoisomerase inhibitor indicated: as a component of multi‑agent adjuvant chemotherapy for treatment of adults with axillary lymph node involvement following resection of primary breast cancer. ( 1.1 ) for the treatment of: acute lymphoblastic leukemia, acute myeloblastic leukemia, Hodgkin lymphoma, Non-Hodgkin lymphoma, metastatic breast cancer, metastatic Wilms&apos; tumor, metastatic neuroblastoma, metastatic soft tissue sarcoma, metastatic bone ...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
<Row>
