<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">11/03/2026</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">Supplemental</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">XGEN PHARMS</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Clonidine hydrochloride injection is indicated in combination with opiates for the treatment of severe pain in cancer patients that is not adequately relieved by opioid analgesics alone. Epidural clonidine is more likely to be effective in patients with neuropathic pain than somatic or visceral pain (see Clinical Trials ). The safety of this drug product has only been established in a highly selected group of cancer patients, and only after an adequate trial of opioid analg...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
