<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Methimazole tablets, USP are indicated: In patients with Graves’ disease with hyperthyroidism or toxic multinodular goiter for whom surgery or radioactive iodine therapy is not an appropriate treatment option. To ameliorate symptoms of hyperthyroidism in preparation for thyroidectomy or radioactive iodine therapy.</Data></Cell>
