<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Tadalafil is a phosphodiesterase 5 (PDE5) inhibitor indicated for the treatment of: erectile dysfunction (ED) (1.1) the signs and symptoms of benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH) (1.2) ED and the signs and symptoms of BPH (ED/BPH) (1.3) If tadalafil tablets are used with finasteride to initiate BPH treatment, such use is recommended for up to 26 weeks (1.4). 1.1 Erectile Dysfunction Tadalafil tablets are indicated for the treatment of erectile dysfunction (ED). 1.2 Benign P...</Data></Cell>
