<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Sodium bicarbonate injection is an alkalinizing agent indicated: to raise plasma pH in adults and pediatric patients with clinically significant metabolic acidosis. ( 1.1 ) to alkalinize the urine in drug poisoning in adult and pediatric patients in cases in which urinary drug elimination is enhanced by urinary alkalinaztion. ( 1.2 ) Limitation of Use Do not use sodium bicarbonate injection in settings where rapid administration of sodium bicarbonate is required, such as ...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
